      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAVUZZI (5) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.3 lengths away in second (20.26) behind Too Many Words at Capalaba. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Can go on with it. SHIMMERING LAD (3) finished well back on debut when seventh (20.72) at Q Lakeside over 352m. Can feature with the right run. WHINGE A LOT (2) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 300m behind Need Ski Money (17.15). One of the main contenders. CHA CHA BLUE (7) is a newcomer from the Noel Murdoch kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can sneak into the frame at his first appearance.",
